@ Strata: the new-game speech is given by Dr. Halvorsen, who runs the Hell Creek dig.

gText_Birch_Welcome::
	.string "Hello! Sorry to keep you waiting!\p"
	.string "Welcome to the HELL CREEK dig, in\n"
	.string "the badlands of eastern Montana.\p"
	.string "My name is HALVORSEN.\p"
	.string "I'm the paleontologist in charge\n"
	.string "of this field season.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_Pokemon::
	.string "This little fellow is a MESODMA.\p"
	.string "\n"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_MainSpeech::
	.string "Its kind lived here 66 million years\n"
	.string "ago, alongside the last dinosaurs.\p"
	.string "Every animal in the rocks here was\n"
	.string "real. We know them from their bones,\l"
	.string "teeth, shells and footprints.\p"
	.string "And with our STRATA rig, we can see\n"
	.string "their world alive again.\p"
	.string "Layer by layer, from the dinosaurs'\n"
	.string "last days up to the present.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AndYouAre::
	.string "And you are?$"

gText_Birch_BoyOrGirl::
	.string "Are you a boy?\n"
	.string "Or are you a girl?$"

gText_Birch_WhatsYourName::
	.string "All right.\n"
	.string "What's your name?$"

gText_Birch_SoItsPlayer::
	.string "So it's {PLAYER}{KUN}?$"

gText_Birch_YourePlayer::
	.string "Ah, of course!\p"
	.string "You're {PLAYER}{KUN}, our new field\n"
	.string "assistant. Welcome to the crew!\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AreYouReady::
	.string "All right, are you ready?\p"
	.string "The rocks here hold 66 million years\n"
	.string "of history.\p"
	.string "Each layer up is a step forward in\n"
	.string "time, and every lineage you meet\l"
	.string "will have to survive it.\p"
	.string "Come and find me at the FIELD\n"
	.string "STATION. Let's get to work!\p"
	.string "$"
